docs/review-v04-codex-sol-last.txt:18:| P1 | Setup synchronization | `inherit-parent` and `auto` generate no binding. Apply merges existing bindings, so switching to inheritance or deleting a row silently retains the old model. [modelSheet.mjs:131-135](/Users/nndsk/Projects/zedpstack/src/modelSheet.mjs:131), [setupConfig.mjs:45-49](/Users/nndsk/Projects/zedpstack/src/setupConfig.mjs:45) | Reconcile generated overrides, including removals. Define inheritance explicitly or reject unsupported inheritance before writing. |
docs/review-v04-codex-sol-last.txt:19:| P1 | Config aliases | New panel/lens aliases require multiple hops, but resolution follows one. Existing v0.3.1 configs consequently fail to resolve architect, interrogate, and reflect roles. Timeout inheritance also stops early. [config.mjs:32-74](/Users/nndsk/Projects/zedpstack/src/config.mjs:32) | Traverse aliases consistently or flatten them to supported fallback bindings. |
docs/review-v04-codex-sol-last.txt:25:| P2, conditional | Read-only enforcement | Claude restricts built-in tools but inherits HOME and host configuration without isolating MCP or hooks. Read-only behavior is therefore configuration-dependent. No exploit was demonstrated. [permissions.mjs:44-102](/Users/nndsk/Projects/zedpstack/src/permissions.mjs:44) | Control inherited settings, hooks, and MCP configuration; verify the effective tool set. |
docs/review-v04-codex-sol-last.txt:27:| P2 | Effort | Setup saves `effort`, but binding resolution discards it entirely. Neither runtime applies it; the documentation understates this as incomplete level support. [config.mjs:61-65](/Users/nndsk/Projects/zedpstack/src/config.mjs:61), [setup skill:53-55](/Users/nndsk/Projects/zedpstack/setup-zedpstack/SKILL.md:53) | Implement verified runtime mappings or report effort as unsupported during setup and dispatch. |
